        "id": 1129199
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-06-22T01:15:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done. Would be great if LLVM could be a little smarter though (our structures are packed, but aligned, so it is possible to determine at compile time whether a member is aligned or not).",
      "parentUuid": "def5edcd_40eb27bf",
      "revId": "bfb174c9155765b6b4ad95cc0408b6efb0f10867",
